From: =?UTF-8?q?Emiliano=20Rom=C3=A1n?= <emiliano.roman@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 13:20:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(form): foco de campos en neutral.900 y 2px

color.form.border-focus: tomato.500 -> neutral.900 (foco y error dejan de compartir rojo).
border-width.focus: 1px -> 2px (afecta select.focus-width).
Consumidores: input.form, input.pill, select.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013i2sRe2vU3Zoymte874HXD
